---
// Ficha de EZ8, portada del prototipo (posiciones del frame de Figma de 1320 px).
---

<div class="pj">
  <!-- Planos + despiece + foto: bloque de y=86 a y=1633 del frame -->
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 1547)">
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:3;--y:0;--w:1313;--h:928"><img src="/img/ez8/01-planos.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:36;--y:850;--w:647;--h:466"><img src="/img/ez8/02-despiece-cocina.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:762;--y:850;--w:558;--h:697"><img src="/img/ez8/03-salon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pj-text" style="--x:75;--w:1144;margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 148)">
    <p>The apartment renovation in Madrid is conceived as an exercise in clarity rather than transformation. Located within a traditional residential building in the city, the project seeks to reinterpret the existing space, enhancing light, proportion, and continuity without erasing its original character.</p>
    <p>The intervention responds to the constraints of the structure and the LONGITUDINAL rhythm of the existing openings, using a restrained palette of materials and precise geometries to create a calm and cohesive interior.</p>
    <p>Natural light becomes the organizing element, guiding circulation and articulating the relationship between rooms.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 741);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 130)">
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:0;--y:0;--w:1320;--h:741"><img src="/img/ez8/04-salon-ventanas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 882);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 95)">
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:47;--y:0;--w:588;--h:882"><img src="/img/ez8/05-mueble-cocina.jpg" alt="" style="--cl:-6.06%;--ct:-0.02%;--cw:106.04%;--ch:106.02%" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pj-text" style="--x:105;--w:1110;margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 95)">
    <p>Rather than imposing a new identity, the project reveals the potential of what was already there—updating the spatial logic, refining details, and establishing a contemporary atmosphere that remains deeply rooted in its urban context.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Tira final: las fotos se solapan en el mismo orden que en Figma -->
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 701);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 87)">
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:546;--y:0;--w:468;--h:701"><img src="/img/ez8/06-dormitorio.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:-2;--y:0;--w:467;--h:701"><img src="/img/01.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:313;--y:0;--w:432;--h:701"><img src="/img/03.jpg" alt="" style="--cl:-8.18%;--cw:108.18%" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:905;--y:0;--w:414;--h:701"><img src="/img/ez8/07-bano.jpg" alt="" style="--cl:-10.25%;--ct:-0.01%;--cw:113.05%;--ch:100.01%" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</div>
